<title>GERMANY: Depfa 9-mo operating profit up 30.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Depfa 9-mo operating profit up 30.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30 (in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provisions    303.5  vs 233.3</p>
<p>    Group bad debt provisions		 125.0  vs 159.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German mortgage bank is Deutsche Pfandbrief- und Hypothekenbank AG.</p>
